{
 "encounter_id": "00855",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Hollis, is it Gerald, Gerald Hollis? You're down for a travel check. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's me. We're off to Tanzania in six weeks, a charity build, and my daughter said I'd better get checked first. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smart daughter. Think of this as a service before a long drive. How are you generally? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. Can't complain. A bit of heartburn, on and off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long's the heartburn been around?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hm. A while. A year? Two? I honestly couldn't say when it began."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your knees?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit stiff in the mornings. Nothing to write home about."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness when you're going uphill?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit puffy on the steep bits. I'm sixty-one, doc."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's your sleep?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Light. I wake a lot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day, for the heartburn. And amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day, for the pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Tell me your medical history."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux, obviously. High blood pressure. And arthritis in the knees, the doctor said."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart disease in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had heart disease, he died at seventy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Civil engineer. Retired three years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I cycle at the weekends, about thirty miles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Pulse 66, blood pressure 126 over 78, and weight 86 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's good, isn't it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's like a clean engine. Let me listen.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fire away. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal and your calves are soft, no swelling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing at rest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any trouble with your stomach apart from the heartburn, vomiting, anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, everything else is normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your blood pressure is well controlled, which is what matters for a trip like this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good to hear. What about vaccines? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a blood test to check your immunity for hepatitis, and I'd like to book your typhoid and hepatitis A vaccines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Are they painful? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little scratch, like a mosquito, only less annoying. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink bottled water, and keep your tablets in your hand luggage."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will do, doc. ~"
  }
